{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser\/organizationLevel","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"organizationLevel","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A4UserV17organizationLevelSbvp","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"organizationLevel","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"abstract":[{"text":"Whether this is an ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"organization-level","type":"text"}]},{"text":" principal (CONTRACT.md §5.2).","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamuser\/organizationlevel"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"organizationLevel"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Such a principal’s record lives in its organization’s reserved tenant, so its global","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"grants apply in every tenant of that organization, and it can act on a different one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by sending a different ","type":"text"},{"code":"X-Axiam-Tenant","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on the next request — no re-login, because it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already is a principal of 